{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37141","headline":"玉声亭 · 郑损","name":"玉声亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间泉石本无价，那更天然落景中。\n汉佩琮琤寒溜雨，秦箫缥缈夜敲风。\n一方清气羣阴伏，半局闲棋万虑空。\n借问主人能住久，後来好事有谁同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}